{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0114_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "836c1a743c220e6f0d3dceb8d34939f89bb2348bd00eabac4751683c8a65b270", "ja": "世界を巡るハーモニー", "zh": "环游世界的和声", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0114_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "39614ba6dbb547fffb8a0fafab94508324395d015ad85a0db56cf9b3f3c32c1d", "ja": "『ARCANA』のライブは大成功！\n自分達が書いたコラムを読む3人のもとへ、\nアイドル達が集まってきて、自然と歌のレッ\nスンが始まる。みんなの想いが込もった歌声\nが、今日も劇場中に広がっていくのだった。", "zh": "『ARCANA』的演唱会大获成功！\n偶像们聚集到正在阅读自己所写专栏的3人身边，\n自然而然地开始了声乐练习。\n蕴含着大家心愿的歌声，\n今天也在剧场中回荡着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0114_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "dc62e85726d81406e82d8373911ffd4cbe27d2248878d224a052204b6338952c", "ja": "（ARCANAの初公演は、大歓声と共に終わった！\n3人の歌声に、会場中のファンが魅了されていた）", "zh": "（ARCANA的首次公演在雷鸣般的欢呼声中落下帷幕！\n3人的歌声让全场的粉丝都为之倾倒）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0114_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_07_1001_p", "source_sha256": "62ebfbd00d7ecf9f8d66f5b578db4437c9f069f192e73b417d372d950ad8838c", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま。\nコラムを書いてもらった雑誌が届いたぞ。", "zh": "大家辛苦了。\n请你们写了专栏的杂志送到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0114_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_07_1002_010azu", "source_sha256": "c32892f48b2c9743dc825b5a31fd262e882102b1905afe27bea749d86e14a251", "ja": "まあ、本当ですか？　書く時は大変でしたけど……\nこうして、雑誌に載ると、なんだかうれしいですね♪", "zh": "真的吗？写的时候可是费了不少功夫……不过，像这样登在杂志上，总觉得还是挺开心的呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0114_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_07_1003_008tak", "source_sha256": "4b12cc3dde7117b99595d8f4763179fa8f908f3cd4e6bd91ce6109a33905c61d", "ja": "ですが、こうして、自身の綴った言葉を\n読まれるというのは……少々面映さを感じます。", "zh": "但是，像这样，自己写下的话被人阅读……\n总觉得有些难为情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0114_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_07_1004_002chi", "source_sha256": "8078144873051b62d224d87f98e91974f846ac4e18a28bcd9fcc9d5d817e5a25", "ja": "ええ、本当に。ステージで歌うのは、\n気にならないのに……どうしてなのかしら。", "zh": "是啊，真的。在舞台上唱歌时明明不会在意……可这是为什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0114_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_07_1005_005yay", "source_sha256": "ea67ba83497c4f355a9c1f51ea5d74a18eef0a57824e1c4d2472639ae3554a4b", "ja": "お疲れさまでーす！　あっ！\nそれって、あずささん達が載ってる雑誌ですかー？", "zh": "辛苦啦——！啊！\n那是刊登着梓小姐她们的杂志吗——？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0114_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_07_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "b33d30d568d6d6ee2b2c56c8bff667e41f241acd914a4da7899114d1b0f85de8", "ja": "わあ～！\nあの、わたし達も見ていいですか？", "zh": "哇～！\n那个，我们也可以看看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0114_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_07_1007_010azu", "source_sha256": "287d5e60f2812a2d7b5979eb8f6d4173b31630c906f1026bb32b7af5f36e5aee", "ja": "もちろんよ。はい、どうぞ♪", "zh": "当然可以呀。来，请看♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0114_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_07_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "6bc3f0b954a00401db6749f25a2ca49c9cdc5969d55597aea7b6ff0f40c3c84e", "ja": "ありがとうございます、あずささん！\nえへへ……わぁ、ステキな写真……♪", "zh": "谢谢您，梓小姐！\n嘿嘿……哇，好棒的照片……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0114_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_07_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "c088995387b7def39e1a6f7cbfd0d7aa50838d29efc85f36eb1172d1b1901515", "ja": "今回のステージ、すごくカッコよかったです！　し……\nし……あ、思い出した！　神秘的って言うんですよね♪", "zh": "这次的舞台真是太帅气了！　神……\n神……啊，我想起来了！是说神秘，对吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0114_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_07_1010_036kan", "source_sha256": "f94e6e33a1d38f6054a1672aecba361c0746543c54f2c60d45b8433bb0f4f7fa", "ja": "それで、私も、もっと歌が上手くなりたい～って！\n千早さん、また歌のレッスン、してもらえますか？", "zh": "所以，我也想变得更擅长唱歌～！\n千早小姐，之后还能请你教我唱歌吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0114_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_07_1011_002chi", "source_sha256": "f2ca36019f6517f23c4a7ef5049a4c7767f1295a3846990deffeb00d9c8efb2e", "ja": "ええ。もちろんよ、矢吹さん。\nそうね。せっかくだし、今からどうかしら？", "zh": "嗯。当然可以，矢吹同学。\n是啊，机会难得，现在开始怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0114_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_07_1012_002chi", "source_sha256": "b6853f1e4bcd80fb16becaa2ab71c1e67e9d1096a22e6595f9ceb00144ffe1a9", "ja": "この時間なら、レッスンルームが空いてたはず……。\n{$P$}、使っても構いませんか？", "zh": "这个时间的话，训练室应该空着……\n{$P$}，可以借用吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0114_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_07_1013_p", "source_sha256": "a062baf92435bb44891ef3b1ed326a31eef1bed18560de7576b8b58dcab217c0", "ja": "ああ、構わないよ。俺も見学しようかな。", "zh": "啊，当然可以。我也去旁观一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0114_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_07_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "19bafe441ff127a9c55877922032b6e1f35446020b595edd32bf8fe88017390d", "ja": "やったやったー！　みんなでレッスンだ～！\n一緒に歌うんだ～♪　えへへっ♪", "zh": "太好啦太好啦——！大家一起上课啦～！\n要一起唱歌啦～♪嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0114_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_07_1015_005yay", "source_sha256": "883a100c2ca2f091517f206a8d1d74fe65b3feb258bc31145229884e4a11e103", "ja": "それじゃ私、レッスンの準備してきますね！", "zh": "那我去准备练习啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0114_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_07_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "d335b0b8731bf5d46ed18670165605f6a994221d4e5fa4f5b82b5c488258cec5", "ja": "やよいさん、わたしもお手伝いします！", "zh": "弥生小姐，我也来帮忙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0114_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_07_1017_008tak", "source_sha256": "80a0a0307018fb42efcc48b28efc46a5ec48cb8d2a17e9bc7408ebad92a54d80", "ja": "では、私達も参りましょうか。\n今日も、賑やかなレッスンになりそうですね。", "zh": "那么，我们也出发吧。\n今天的训练似乎也会很热闹呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0114_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_07_1018_010azu", "source_sha256": "1306ca9cd19dc7367cdbf97964b658519ed41c89da393e9f5c9cfd791bd8c3eb", "ja": "あの、{$P$}さん。\n……少し、お時間よろしいですか？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}先生。\n……能耽误您一点时间吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0114_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_07_1019_p", "source_sha256": "8d071aa43230b8450eccc42b02930511d7328442f95d3d2181749682947c016d", "ja": "あずささん、どうしました？", "zh": "梓小姐，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0114_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_07_1020_010azu", "source_sha256": "d82475cccbb9eae1fd69638350364c0a442611e4b3a195228f033361fc689c82", "ja": "はい。あの、今回は……いえ、今回もですね。\n{$P$}さんに、お世話になりました。", "zh": "是的。那个，这次……不，这次也是。承蒙{$P$}先生照顾了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0114_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_07_1021_010azu", "source_sha256": "4aafeecea57ff08e1f94d811313a31709990dce4b8fde861f70a21618281819f", "ja": "私、このお仕事がなかったら……どうして自分が\n歌うのか、向き合ったりしなかったかもしれません。", "zh": "如果没有这份工作……我可能不会去正视自己为什么要唱歌这个问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0114_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_07_1022_p", "source_sha256": "5c9333040952d01b66af1b9346a0f991d4ce0c3a9cb072407d1454780a2d6a92", "ja": "きっかけは、そうかもしれませんけど……\nあずささんなら、いつか考えた事だと思います。", "zh": "契机或许是这样……但如果是阿梓姐，我想总有一天也会思考这件事的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0114_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_07_1023_p", "source_sha256": "741641d6f358f775394eed12d3d8ff3a225cb847d581f7ed7e4c0199955be3ce", "ja": "でも、今回のユニット活動をする事であずささんに\n得られるものがあったなら、良かったです。", "zh": "不过，如果这次组合活动能让梓小姐有所收获，那就太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0114_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_07_1024_010azu", "source_sha256": "e6c18574f553885f75587fb69c54c20f81edc546879ef62d5d4bd10f505f02ac", "ja": "はい。私には、こんな風に……私を信じて、\n受け止めてくれる{$P$}さんがいる。", "zh": "是的。对我来说，身边有这样相信我、接纳我的{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0114_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_07_1025_010azu", "source_sha256": "d6bb49fdc098a5c8eb65fdd1e7c668ef9b2a47c3c2347aff3a367825092c8449", "ja": "だから私は、安心して歌えるんだと……\nそのことにも、気づけました。", "zh": "所以，我也发现，自己正是因此才能安心地歌唱……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0114_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_07_1026_p", "source_sha256": "7f64bd44f91324edbf5bfeb142d8dc3ce2c67eafd04aaf128f656c66d91b35fe", "ja": "あずささん……。", "zh": "梓小姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0114_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_07_1027_010azu", "source_sha256": "a4d42dd4993eb49b14e7844b21cc9f92ea0bf95c2dcf52c708dea7806ad0051a", "ja": "私がアイドルになったきっかけ。それはもう、本当に\n……。もう、いいのかもしれません。うふふっ♪", "zh": "我成为偶像的契机。那个嘛，真的……。也许不说也无妨了呢。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0114_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_07_1028_p", "source_sha256": "a973bb74352b908f3e4ea95a1f71c6d2be3922367e5ce9a4b4939ad528b8ce1c", "ja": "そ、それは、良かったというか……そうだ、やよいから\n聞きましたよ。先輩の赤ちゃん、生まれたそうですね！", "zh": "那、那还真是太好了……该怎么说呢……对了，我听弥生说了。听说前辈的宝宝出生了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0114_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_07_1029_010azu", "source_sha256": "7766f43a5c8db2cfb9c87a065e5533d2459b84c71427497b872dff2d93329421", "ja": "はい、そうなんです。\n赤ちゃん、とってもかわいかったですよ♪", "zh": "是的，没错。\n那个宝宝特别可爱呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0114_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_07_1030_010azu", "source_sha256": "8d8e7e3419d15d200abcc4b776affb4ca917c2fbec1544dfd9529a2d9e034ab3", "ja": "なんだか、昔よりずっと楽しそうに見えて……\n私、ちょっぴりうらやましくなってしまいました。", "zh": "总觉得她看起来比以前开心多了……\n让我都有点羡慕了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0114_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_07_1031_p", "source_sha256": "1b99f82bbd7e617a4b5741f5b3a985714564642eba52c7e7f549107aa5723cfc", "ja": "なるほど……\nえっ、うらやましい？", "zh": "原来如此……\n诶，羡慕？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0114_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_07_1032_010azu", "source_sha256": "39a25df36b9003026db6552f2f60cbb52e7d93f9613b448c154961b42ac21b56", "ja": "はい、とっても幸せそうでしたから♪\n子守唄を歌って聞かせる姿も、とっても……♪", "zh": "是的，因为看起来非常幸福♪\n唱着摇篮曲哄孩子入睡的样子，也非常……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0114_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_07_1033_010azu", "source_sha256": "782f676c1739c7f1f3798b3fb5397533edd20821d23dbd125b93fc5da108d749", "ja": "どんな人生を歩んでいても。\n歌う楽しさは……。喜びは、変わらないんですね。", "zh": "无论走过怎样的人生。\n歌唱的快乐……歌唱的喜悦，都是不会改变的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0114_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_07_1034_p", "source_sha256": "f80bb9bfc56b1082bb23c903dfd52e79398a3d7685796b0d7c158c94251ecdad", "ja": "……ええ。きっと、そうだと思います。", "zh": "……嗯。我也觉得一定是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0114_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_07_1035_010azu", "source_sha256": "3720425c075d9cfca5ce4611bd613be3b8d2d852b0f9c3d28068f4193eaaef42", "ja": "でも、私はアイドルですから。先輩に負けない\nように、たくさん歌わなくちゃいけませんね。", "zh": "不过，我可是偶像。所以，为了不输给前辈，得多唱些歌才行呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0114_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_07_1036_002chi", "source_sha256": "62ca86386f0d8ad98b8525b554ed4ecb94b45ce69519831637b35ff831b49f49", "ja": "あずささん、{$P$}も。\nレッスン、もう始めても？", "zh": "あずさ小姐，{$P$}也要一起吗？可以开始训练了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0114_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_07_1037_010azu", "source_sha256": "92eaadd0821ee5c0ae86b1764f86b5c736ca085bcaa7ecc08c710250faf63431", "ja": "あら……ごめんなさい。\n私ったら、つい話に夢中になってしまって。", "zh": "哎呀……不好意思。\n我真是的，聊着聊着不知不觉就入迷了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0114_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_07_1038_008tak", "source_sha256": "673ae7f16c4f888233eebdfbcd11ede0bb38ba9c46b24925cff0b0f204358949", "ja": "何やら楽しげな様子ですね。\nどのような話をしていたのですか？", "zh": "看起来聊得很开心呢。\n刚才在聊什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0114_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_07_1039_010azu", "source_sha256": "b67cf387d41b64475d31f954a99b8a80532e5e4d49e1e569781cef2ef8b2963f", "ja": "それは……ふふ、秘密♪　さあ、みんな行きましょう。\n{$P$}さんも一緒に、ね？", "zh": "那是……呵呵，秘密♪　好了，大家一起走吧。\n也和{$P$}先生一起，好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0114_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_07_1040_p", "source_sha256": "4f2356bd3dd5f4fa47e6be9c11db6987ae1b4b34cb92118e235850dfd29dedfa", "ja": "（ARCANAから始まった歌がどんどん広がっていく。\nみんなが歌に込めた想いと、一緒に……）", "zh": "（从ARCANA开始的歌声不断传开。\n也和大家寄托在歌声中的心意一起……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0114_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_07_1041_p", "source_sha256": "e3447bb7ccd748a3f12963bc956748bd04f1ce412cdd9d1b77c8ab764befc3cd", "ja": "（けど、ユニットとしての活動は始まったばかり。\n3人の魅力をもっと伝えられるよう、俺も頑張ろう！）", "zh": "（不过，作为组合的活动才刚刚开始。为了让更多人了解3人的魅力，我也要加油！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
